# Python bytecode. 40 .pyc files were tracked until 2026-09-23 and showed up as
# modified on every single run, burying the real diff.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Logs. galil_log.txt rotates at 10 MB and has produced 10k-line diffs; the
# hardware test scripts each write their own .log beside themselves.
galil_log*.txt
*.log

# NOT ignored: encoder_measure*, encoder_measurements.txt and
# encoder_average_backlash.txt. They look like generated output but they are
# tracked measurement records, and ignoring them would hide a re-created one.

# Local machine state, not configuration. These are written by the app at
# runtime and are specific to one rig and one session.
#
# NOT ignored, deliberately: config/settings.json, config/zero_offsets.json,
# config/positions.json, config/last_direction.json and
# config/z_retract_state.json. They are hand-edited or carry state that must
# survive a clone - zero_offsets.json in particular is the rig's declared zero,
# last_direction.json is the only record of which end of travel A and B are
# sitting at, and z_retract_state.json is the only record of whether the Z head
# is parked off the scale tape, which nothing on the rig can be asked.

# pytest's cache. It ships its own .gitignore so it was already excluded, but
# stating it here means the rule does not depend on that file surviving.
.pytest_cache/

# Virtual environments
venv/
.venv/
env/

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Vendor material, excluded 2026-09-24 when the project was pushed to GitHub.
# 184 MB of Galil/Numerik Jena manuals and installers - gdk_2.4.1.exe alone is
# 120 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB per-file hard limit, and all of it is vendor
# copyrighted and downloadable from galil.com. CLAUDE.md cites files in here
# (gdk_commands.txt, encoder manual.pdf, manipulator Z.pdf); they stay on disk
# locally, they are just not redistributed.
Galil/

# The operator manual is BADLY STALE - every direction in it is wrong for Y and
# Z since the 2026-09-24 software reversal, and it describes a sidebar and a
# settings panel that no longer match. Excluded rather than shipped, because a
# manual that drives the stage the wrong way is worse than no manual.
# Regenerate it and drop this line. See CLAUDE.md.
Galil_Controller_Suite_Manual.pdf

# Installer build artifacts (packaging/). The frozen app is ~200 MB and the
# setup .exe ~80 MB; both are rebuilt from source by
# `python packaging/build_installer.py`, so neither belongs in git.
# The generated icon IS tracked - it is an asset, and rebuilding it on every
# machine would churn the binary for no reason.
packaging/_dist/
packaging/_build/
packaging/_output/
